This product includes software developed for the CockroachDB × AWS Hackathon
("Build with Agentic Memory", submission period 2026-06-30 to 2026-08-18).

Pre-existing work incorporated into this repository, disclosed as the
hackathon rules require:

  * `content/` — RemixKit, an asset-generation pipeline, and `app/`, the
    console that serves it. Both predate this hackathon's submission period
    and were built for an earlier, unrelated hackathon. They are retained as
    a subproject and are not part of the agentic-memory work being submitted.
    See `docs/SCOPE-RESET.md` for the scope decision that made them a
    subproject.

  * The agentic memory platform submitted to this hackathon lives entirely in
    `platform/`, first committed 2026-08-06, inside the submission period.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licences; see
`platform/web/requirements.txt` for the pinned set.

Vendored data:

  * `platform/web/spindle/static/world.json` — country outlines, derived
    from Natural Earth 1:110m Admin 0 Countries. Natural Earth is public
    domain (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/); no
    attribution is required and this note is courtesy. The file is a
    reduction: ISO alpha-2 keys only, coordinates rounded to one decimal
    place and stored as integers, which takes it from 820 KB to 90 KB. Two of
    the 177 source features (N. Cyprus, Somaliland) carry no ISO code and are
    absent, because there is no code to join counterparty counts on.
